      "text": "PythonExecutorToolkit\n支持本地 IPython 持久化环境（变量共享）\n支持远程 e2b 沙箱执行\n工具: execute_python_code(code,\ntimeout)",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "Z4It96PFPtndMYUAsKEr_",
      "originalText": "PythonExecutorToolkit\n支持本地 IPython 持久化环境（变量共享）\n支持远程 e2b 沙箱执行\n工具: execute_python_code(code, timeout)",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
